[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=19 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="护航图是在饭桌上画完的。女人收走碗，给你们让出一块干燥桌面。男孩抱着一只装灯芯的铁盒不肯放，说盒扣不好，交给别人就要撒。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们送你们穿过外环，到了信标再分开走。谁的动力不稳，现在就说。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="step"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="老人"

text="说了会不让走吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="说了我把慢船放前面。等开起来才掉队，就得在危险处重新排。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="老人点点头，报了自己的速度。帕金斯在图上擦掉一段，又画得宽了一些。没有人因为那条线变长而叹气，连德雷顿都收起了玩笑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="外面有会直线扑击的实体。出现很直的预警带，就离开它将要通过的地方，别拿船头接。它冲完要停一会儿，那时才是还手的机会。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们不一定要消灭它？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="这次先把人送过去。它不挡路，就别为了追它拆开队形。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="男孩"

text="我能看外面吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="能，但不许越过这根绳。听见我喊蹲下就蹲，不用先找我在哪。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="他认真点头，随后问你那块空胸牌是不是忘了写。你说暂时还没想好，他把自己的铅笔掰下一半，说想好了可以借你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我已经有一支了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="男孩"

text="那你还能给别人一支。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把两截铅笔放在一起。一截削得很尖，一截被咬出了牙印。弗莱彻等你收好，才把图卷起来，问你最后一遍：有没有哪艘还没算进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="最后面那条维修艇。它不载客，不过回程我们还得靠它修桥。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="好。一起带上。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

